  "plain": "In the 1970s, the Church of Scientology is said to have run Operation Snow White, a large effort to infiltrate several government agencies, among them the IRS and the CIA. Jay Anderson, a researcher, mentions it in passing to Michels without naming a source, calling it a \"huge like infiltration of multiple agencies\". If true, it would mean a private group got its people inside the agencies that kept secrets about it."
